  "main_html": "<section class=\"hero training-marker\" data-training-page=\"true\" style=\"background:#fff3cd;border:3px solid #d97706;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px\"><p class=\"kicker\">TRAINING PAGE</p><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0\">Training page</h1><p><strong>Sandbox only.</strong> Not a production or sponsor-facing page.</p><p class=\"muted\">This page is copied from the real canonical pack and marked as training.</p></section>\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Neuro Evaluation Guides \u00b7 Independent educational publisher</p>\n  <h1>Neuro Evaluation Guides</h1>\n  <p class=\"muted\">Neuro Evaluation Guides publishes decision frameworks for ADHD and autism evaluations, therapy next-step guides, and local market pages.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section conversion-cta conversion-cta--primary\" data-primary-conversion-cta=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"conversion-cta__panel conversion-cta__panel--primary\">\n    <p class=\"conversion-cta__eyebrow\">Start here</p>\n    <h2 class=\"conversion-cta__heading\">View your next steps</h2>\n    <p class=\"conversion-cta__body\">Use the dedicated next-steps path after you review the homepage short answer, provider preview, and state routing.</p>\n    <p class=\"conversion-cta__actions\">\n      <a class=\"button button-primary conversion-cta__button\" href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/next-steps/?src=%2F&amp;intent=decision_hub&amp;button=next_steps_cta&amp;vertical=neuro&amp;page_kind=global&amp;page_slug=home\" data-provider-type=\"Neuro Evaluation Provider\" data-page-src=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/\" data-button-source=\"next_steps_cta\" data-intent-type=\"decision_hub\" data-market-slug=\"\" data-page-kind=\"global\" data-vertical-key=\"neuro\">View Your Next Steps</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"callout answer-block\" data-home-answer=\"true\" data-short-answer=\"true\">\n  <h2>Short answer</h2>\n  <p>Neuro Evaluation Guides is a neutral, educational resource that helps people understand ADHD and autism evaluations and how providers differ. Most useful when you still need to compare testing scope, timelines, costs, and follow-up expectations, Neuro Evaluation Guides explains what typically happens before and after an evaluation. Neuro Evaluation Guides does not recommend specific providers, but it does help you decide which local comparison path to open next.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" data-home-about-block=\"true\">\n  <h2>About Neuro Evaluation Guides</h2>\n  <p>Neuro Evaluation Guides exists to explain how evaluations work, what questions narrow the decision fastest, and what to verify before contacting any provider.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section provider-directory-section provider-directory-section--preview\" data-provider-directory=\"true\" data-home-provider-preview=\"true\"><h2>Examples of providers</h2><p class=\"muted\">These are neutral, non-ranked examples of evaluation providers so the homepage feels concrete before you narrow into a state or city page.</p><div class=\"provider-directory-grid\"><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">ADHD Online</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Neuro evaluation provider \u2014 Atlanta, GA</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>Use this when you are comparing ADHD / neuro evaluation options</li><li>Ask what the report, testing scope, and feedback session actually include</li></ul></article><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">LifeStance Health</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Neuro evaluation provider \u2014 Atlanta, GA</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>Offers therapy follow-up</li><li>Use this when you are comparing ADHD / neuro evaluation options</li><li>Ask what the report, testing scope, and feedback session actually include</li></ul></article><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">Talkiatry</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Neuro evaluation provider \u2014 Atlanta, GA</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>Offers therapy follow-up</li><li>Use this when you are comparing ADHD / neuro evaluation options</li><li>Ask what the report, testing scope, and feedback session actually include</li></ul></article><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">As You Are</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Autism evaluation provider \u2014 Atlanta, GA</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>Use this when you are comparing autism evaluation options</li><li>Ask what the report, testing scope, and feedback session actually include</li></ul></article></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section faq-entry-card\" data-home-faq-entry=\"true\"><h2>Need quick answers first?</h2><p class=\"muted\">Use the FAQ when you want definitions, costs, timing questions, and fast clarification before you open a state page.</p><p class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button button-secondary\" href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/faq/\">Open the FAQ for Neuro Evaluation Guides</a></p></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" data-home-state-grid-shell=\"true\">\n  <h2>Browse by state</h2>\n  <p class=\"muted\">Start with your state to narrow into city pages, provider examples, and licensing resources.</p>\n  <div class=\"state-card-grid\" data-home-state-grid=\"true\"><div class=\"grid\" data-markets-status-list=\"states\"><div class=\"card\"><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0\"><a href=\"https://local-guides-generator.pages.dev/states/AK/\">AK</a></h3><p clas